WEBVTT

1
00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:29.159
♪ <i>If this rope breaks, we can ♪
♪ buy a new one at Busan Port</i> ♪

2
00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:39.136
♪ <i>If our rope breaks, we can make a new ♪
♪ ones from the trees of Halla Mountain</i> ♪

3
00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:43.204
♪ <i>Row the boat ♪
♪ Let's go to Ieodo</i> ♪

4
00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:47.513
♪ <i>Let's fight our way ♪
♪ through the waves</i> ♪

5
00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:49.611
♪ <i>Row the boat ♪
♪ Let's go to Ieodo</i> ♪

6
00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:53.021
♪ <i>Let's fight our way ♪
♪ through the waves</i> ♪

7
00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:19.349
Grandma, be careful!

8
00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:23.186
I'm jealous of you for having
such a sweet grandchild!

9
00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:28.358
It's Mr. Dolphin!

10
00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:35.222
Mr. Dolphin, please tell my dad
that I, Hye-ji is doing fine!

11
00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:43.139
Grandma!

12
00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:46.200
Which is bigger, the sea or the sky?

13
00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.573
The sea is bigger.

14
00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:53.743
Have you been to the end of both?

15
00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.349
No, but I know the answer.

16
00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:00.280
How do you know?

17
00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.324
As you grow old...

18
00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:08.289
You learn these things naturally.

19
00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:16.500
Can I go out into the sea, too?

20
00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.634
Of course. Let's go together.

21
00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.202
Wow, really?

22
00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:23.104
True.

23
00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:30.279
<i>Grandma Gye-chun</i>

24
00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:37.456
Grandma, I'm scared!

25
00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:41.732
Grandma!

26
00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:44.600
Grandma, I'm scared!

27
00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:48.195
Hye-ji, why didn't you wake me up?

28
00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:49.672
I'll scare him off.

29
00:03:49.729 --> 00:03:51.530
Get away from there!

30
00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:53.943
- Toya go away!
- Go away!

31
00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.502
Toya, go away!

32
00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:58.515
- Come here.
- Grandma, I'm scared!

33
00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:01.685
Go to sleep...

34
00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:09.391
If you need to poop, wake me
up or use the chamber pot.

35
00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:11.690
Don't go to the outhouse by yourself.

36
00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:15.398
I thought Toya was asleep.

37
00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:17.693
Did you?

38
00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.270
You should just eat that pig!

39
00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:25.400
Don't eat him!

40
00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:29.179
Baekgu!

41
00:04:30.637 --> 00:04:31.637
Hi, Baekgu.

42
00:04:31.738 --> 00:04:35.777
Seok-ho, come on out!

43
00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:40.956
Mrs. Hong...

44
00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:44.695
It's not even 6 a.m.!

45
00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:46.985
Don't glare at me with your round eyes!

46
00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:50.559
Would you prefer triangle eyes, then?

47
00:04:57.764 --> 00:04:58.764
Hye-ji.

48
00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:02.212
- Play with this.
- Thank you.

49
00:05:04.704 --> 00:05:05.704
Honey...

50
00:05:08.675 --> 00:05:11.178
- Wait here.
- Okay.

51
00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:28.463
Grandma, did you catch a lot?

52
00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:32.007
It's time to head back!

53
00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:43.742
Oh!

54
00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:46.151
What's going on?

55
00:05:52.552 --> 00:05:56.261
I'll be right back, sweetie.

56
00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.093
This...

57
00:06:01.594 --> 00:06:02.664
Grandma?

58
00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:08.208
I got you! Damn thing.

59
00:06:08.267 --> 00:06:11.612
Oh my. Come in.

60
00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:15.481
- Grandma!
- Huh?

61
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:16.541
Hye-ji, I'm right here!

62
00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:18.647
Where are you?

63
00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:21.453
Oh, sweetie...

64
00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:23.715
Were you scared?

65
00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:25.696
<i>Stationery store</i>

66
00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:28.232
What is it?

67
00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:30.689
All right, hold still.

68
00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:32.897
All right, all right.
Why are you doing this?

69
00:06:37.697 --> 00:06:39.370
Hye-ji...

70
00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:42.003
I'll buy it for you later.

71
00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:43.668
I want it now.

72
00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:46.741
Don't touch it if you're
not going to buy it.

73
00:06:47.106 --> 00:06:49.741
- How much is it?
- 6,000 won.

74
00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:53.383
It only costs 6,000 won,
so don't be so petty!

75
00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:59.128
That's worth more than 6000 won,
but keep the change.

76
00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:01.365
Hye-ji, let's go.

77
00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:03.901
- Goodbye.
- Eels are expensive...

78
00:07:05.691 --> 00:07:06.965
Thank you!

79
00:07:08.361 --> 00:07:10.102
This will make me virile!

80
00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:15.306
Toya!

81
00:07:16.702 --> 00:07:20.411
Look at my new crayons!
Cool, isn't it?

82
00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:24.042
Hmph.

83
00:07:34.086 --> 00:07:36.566
I should have bought
it for her sooner.

84
00:07:43.029 --> 00:07:44.406
Hye-ji!

85
00:07:45.164 --> 00:07:47.041
I'm right here!

86
00:07:47.099 --> 00:07:48.942
This is our family!

87
00:07:49.702 --> 00:07:53.377
You, me and Toya.

88
00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:08.792
I have gold tooth right here!

89
00:08:08.855 --> 00:08:10.960
The gold crayon is
only for grandma.

90
00:08:11.023 --> 00:08:14.693
This gold tooth is
my best feature!

91
00:08:14.694 --> 00:08:16.935
Please color it gold!

92
00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:18.441
No!

93
00:08:18.498 --> 00:08:19.498
Then...

94
00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:23.512
I'll give you 500 won
to color it gold.

95
00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:25.983
Here's 500 won.

96
00:08:27.473 --> 00:08:28.577
Thank you!

97
00:08:28.641 --> 00:08:31.349
So, make it gold.

98
00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:34.647
I still can't.

99
00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:38.689
Then, give me my 500 won back.

100
00:08:38.918 --> 00:08:41.694
Hye-ji, stop right there!

101
00:08:45.525 --> 00:08:48.727
Are you going to see
your dad today?

102
00:08:48.728 --> 00:08:49.728
Yes.

103
00:08:51.163 --> 00:08:53.268
Does that make you happy?

104
00:08:53.499 --> 00:08:54.705
Yes, it does!

105
00:08:55.501 --> 00:08:57.378
Dad, eat this.

106
00:09:08.047 --> 00:09:13.047
Everyone wants me to draw
them because I'm so talented!

107
00:09:14.687 --> 00:09:16.688
I will draw grandma first

108
00:09:16.689 --> 00:09:19.192
and then you.

109
00:09:19.692 --> 00:09:20.966
Hye-ji!

110
00:09:23.896 --> 00:09:26.137
Dad, see you!

111
00:09:33.005 --> 00:09:34.006
Let's go to bed.

112
00:09:34.707 --> 00:09:38.917
Can't I finish coloring your hair?

113
00:09:38.978 --> 00:09:43.654
We have to wake up early to
fly to a wedding tomorrow.

114
00:09:43.716 --> 00:09:45.093
Let's sleep.

115
00:09:50.256 --> 00:09:54.726
Sleep closer to me
so you won't get cold.

116
00:09:54.727 --> 00:09:57.708
My grandchild is already
making my life easier.

117
00:10:03.369 --> 00:10:05.940
Grandma, What's a wedding?

118
00:10:06.405 --> 00:10:07.907
A wedding is...

119
00:10:10.309 --> 00:10:13.256
A man and woman
becoming partners.

120
00:10:13.746 --> 00:10:16.226
What about my dad's partner?

121
00:10:18.184 --> 00:10:19.993
Do you miss your mom?

122
00:10:20.052 --> 00:10:22.726
No, I have you.

123
00:10:34.967 --> 00:10:38.073
Take advantage of today's sale!

124
00:10:38.137 --> 00:10:39.377
Take your time.

125
00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:40.772
How much is that?

126
00:10:40.773 --> 00:10:43.310
- 5,000 won.
- It's expensive.

127
00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:45.754
Oh the little girl knows
that's my shop as well.

128
00:10:46.112 --> 00:10:47.182
Grandma!

129
00:10:47.246 --> 00:10:49.192
It's so pretty, I want it!

130
00:10:49.248 --> 00:10:50.782
- Come here.
- Get over here.

131
00:10:50.783 --> 00:10:54.697
I'll sell you those two
pieces at 6,000 won.

132
00:10:55.788 --> 00:10:58.166
Let me see. It's very pretty.

133
00:11:28.621 --> 00:11:29.691
Hye-ji.

134
00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.368
Hye-ji!

135
00:12:13.132 --> 00:12:15.976
Hye-ji!

136
00:12:20.439 --> 00:12:22.942
Hye-ji!

137
00:12:24.744 --> 00:12:28.692
<i>12 years later</i>

138
00:12:33.385 --> 00:12:35.365
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

139
00:12:36.155 --> 00:12:38.294
- How may I help you?
- Is this any good?

140
00:12:38.357 --> 00:12:41.065
It's a great foundation.

141
00:12:44.497 --> 00:12:48.104
- How much is this?
- 32,000 won.

142
00:12:48.167 --> 00:12:49.510
It's not that expensive.

143
00:12:51.036 --> 00:12:52.106
Please look around.

144
00:12:52.171 --> 00:12:53.772
Hye-ji, let's go.

145
00:12:53.773 --> 00:12:56.049
Thank you, come again.

146
00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.215
Hey, are you crazy?

147
00:13:02.281 --> 00:13:03.281
Give it back!

148
00:13:03.315 --> 00:13:04.919
You are crazy!

149
00:13:05.084 --> 00:13:06.586
What did you steal?

150
00:13:08.988 --> 00:13:10.695
I'm killing you.

151
00:13:11.023 --> 00:13:13.025
They cut off our electricity.

152
00:13:14.727 --> 00:13:16.331
It's so cold, I can see my breath.

153
00:13:17.196 --> 00:13:19.938
You should steal more valuable stuff.

154
00:13:20.399 --> 00:13:21.639
I'm starving.

155
00:13:22.334 --> 00:13:24.541
I'm not going to lend you any of these!

156
00:13:26.739 --> 00:13:28.673
You should just get another eye.

157
00:13:28.674 --> 00:13:33.645
I'm 800 thousand won away from a nose job.

158
00:13:33.646 --> 00:13:38.061
Don't spread embarrassing pictures
of me when I become an idol star.

159
00:13:40.686 --> 00:13:44.293
Don't use my precious
makeup to draw pictures!

160
00:13:46.392 --> 00:13:48.736
Get back to making your eyes pretty.

161
00:13:49.261 --> 00:13:52.003
Okay, I will.

162
00:13:52.164 --> 00:13:57.637
What the hell is it? Picture? Picasso?

163
00:13:57.937 --> 00:14:00.213
Why are they laughing so loud?

164
00:14:06.412 --> 00:14:07.452
Were you talking about me?

165
00:14:07.513 --> 00:14:08.513
No.

166
00:14:08.714 --> 00:14:11.058
Let's go eat something.

167
00:14:11.116 --> 00:14:13.653
- Hurry up.
- Close the window.

168
00:14:23.696 --> 00:14:26.643
- 'What will you wear?'
- Let's say 'I'll go naked.'

169
00:14:26.699 --> 00:14:28.542
- That's too much.
- 'I'll be naked.'

170
00:14:29.001 --> 00:14:31.379
How ridiculous. He liked that joke.

171
00:14:32.304 --> 00:14:33.578
We got him.

172
00:14:34.373 --> 00:14:35.579
Tonight at 11 o'clock.

173
00:14:37.376 --> 00:14:40.289
Go pretend to be a prostitute.

174
00:14:40.412 --> 00:14:41.412
Me?

175
00:14:42.514 --> 00:14:45.256
That's too scary.

176
00:14:50.656 --> 00:14:51.656
Hey.

177
00:14:52.658 --> 00:14:53.658
Hey.

178
00:14:54.426 --> 00:14:56.303
What is it that you do?

179
00:14:56.362 --> 00:14:58.638
All you do is eat food!

180
00:14:58.731 --> 00:14:59.875
Surely you have the drug, right?

181
00:14:59.899 --> 00:15:01.003
Stop it.

182
00:15:03.435 --> 00:15:06.439
- I'll do it.
- Hye-ji, don't.

183
00:15:07.106 --> 00:15:08.710
Oh, Hye-ji!

184
00:15:11.777 --> 00:15:13.279
It's only pretending, right?

185
00:15:16.115 --> 00:15:18.117
I should sell my stocks.

186
00:15:20.352 --> 00:15:21.990
It's open.

187
00:15:25.057 --> 00:15:26.092
Lock the door.

188
00:15:31.397 --> 00:15:32.397
Well...

189
00:15:32.865 --> 00:15:34.776
You want mango juice?

190
00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.216
<i>Room 204</i>

191
00:15:52.217 --> 00:15:53.958
Good, great.

192
00:15:56.355 --> 00:15:57.675
Aren't you going to take a shower?

193
00:15:58.223 --> 00:16:00.134
I can't be bothered.

194
00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.096
Hey, hey!

195
00:16:09.101 --> 00:16:12.207
Don't be like that.

196
00:16:13.605 --> 00:16:14.605
Come on, sit back down.

197
00:16:18.978 --> 00:16:20.116
I'll go shower.

198
00:17:00.452 --> 00:17:01.897
What were you doing?

199
00:17:04.957 --> 00:17:07.301
- Go shower.
- Okay.

200
00:17:10.829 --> 00:17:12.240
Aren't you taking your clothes off?

201
00:17:14.233 --> 00:17:16.543
I'll take them off in the shower.

202
00:17:36.221 --> 00:17:37.427
- There he is.
- What the hell?

203
00:17:37.489 --> 00:17:39.025
- Take the picture!
- Who are you?

204
00:17:39.091 --> 00:17:40.570
Knock it off, I'm warning you!

205
00:17:40.626 --> 00:17:42.572
- You're looking good!
- Knock it off!

206
00:17:44.029 --> 00:17:46.407
Why are you so scrawny?

207
00:17:46.465 --> 00:17:47.136
Huh?

208
00:17:47.232 --> 00:17:50.111
You're working these pimps?

209
00:17:52.071 --> 00:17:54.551
- Pimps, you say?
- We're her brothers.

210
00:17:54.606 --> 00:17:56.779
You think you can fight
your way out of this?

211
00:17:57.076 --> 00:17:58.076
Huh?

212
00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:01.120
You were just caught with a minor.

213
00:18:01.547 --> 00:18:02.355
What do you want?

214
00:18:02.414 --> 00:18:03.415
10 million won.

215
00:18:03.482 --> 00:18:05.484
Are you crazy?

216
00:18:05.584 --> 00:18:08.861
If you won't pay up we'll send
these photos to your wife

217
00:18:08.954 --> 00:18:12.163
and your colleagues and friends.

218
00:18:13.425 --> 00:18:14.563
Wrap it up!

219
00:18:17.196 --> 00:18:18.368
Mister.

220
00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.576
I'm going easy on you.

221
00:18:21.033 --> 00:18:22.205
What's the password?

222
00:18:23.602 --> 00:18:24.602
Hm?

223
00:18:25.671 --> 00:18:27.582
Damn it!

224
00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.510
- What are you doing?
- Ouch!

225
00:18:29.575 --> 00:18:32.181
- What the hell?
- Get off!

226
00:18:32.244 --> 00:18:33.655
Son of a bitch!

227
00:18:33.712 --> 00:18:35.714
Damn it!

228
00:18:37.316 --> 00:18:38.316
Hey!

229
00:18:38.684 --> 00:18:41.164
- Come here, come here.
- Burglar!

230
00:18:42.554 --> 00:18:44.659
- Stop it!
- Son of a bitch!

231
00:18:45.057 --> 00:18:45.592
Hey!

232
00:18:45.657 --> 00:18:47.603
- Dumbass!
- Douchebag!

233
00:18:47.659 --> 00:18:50.230
- Trying to sleep with a minor!
- Enough!

234
00:18:50.295 --> 00:18:52.707
You don't know when to stop, do you?

235
00:18:59.471 --> 00:19:02.673
Why did you stomp on him so hard?

236
00:19:02.674 --> 00:19:04.415
You hit first.

237
00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.288
It's nothing.
He can't call the cops anyway.

238
00:19:14.353 --> 00:19:15.597
It's the motel owner
we should be worried about.

239
00:19:15.621 --> 00:19:16.621
Dude.

240
00:19:17.189 --> 00:19:18.964
What if he's dead?

241
00:19:21.293 --> 00:19:22.465
Shut up!

242
00:19:23.495 --> 00:19:24.940
You said he fell on his own.

243
00:19:25.164 --> 00:19:26.641
- Let's just go to the police...
- Min-hee.

244
00:19:26.665 --> 00:19:28.508
If you don't keep your mouth shut

245
00:19:28.567 --> 00:19:30.034
we're all dead.

246
00:19:30.035 --> 00:19:31.309
Fine.

247
00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.440
I won't say anything.

248
00:19:35.507 --> 00:19:36.611
Give me your phone.

249
00:19:37.042 --> 00:19:38.680
I'll get rid of it, along with his.

250
00:19:41.046 --> 00:19:44.892
We should scatter for a while
and contact each other later.

251
00:19:53.525 --> 00:19:55.334
Why are you out in the cold?

252
00:19:55.394 --> 00:19:57.704
Go someplace else.

253
00:20:07.039 --> 00:20:09.076
I'm back.

254
00:20:10.108 --> 00:20:12.554
Where have you been?

255
00:20:15.547 --> 00:20:17.322
I didn't steal these.

256
00:20:18.083 --> 00:20:22.054
I dipped into my emergency savings fund.

257
00:20:25.123 --> 00:20:26.124
Thanks.

258
00:20:27.092 --> 00:20:30.096
It's not much, but let's not lose dignity.

259
00:20:31.363 --> 00:20:35.099
Should we use steak knives?

260
00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.341
- That's not funny.
- Should we grill this?

261
00:20:37.402 --> 00:20:38.402
Just eat.

262
00:20:41.607 --> 00:20:45.680
Look, you and this girl
have the same name.

263
00:20:47.012 --> 00:20:49.014
But her last name isn't Cha.

264
00:20:59.157 --> 00:21:02.059
<i>Missing child Lee Hye-ji</i>

265
00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.539
Hurry up and drink.

266
00:21:07.666 --> 00:21:09.441
I'll drink it later.

267
00:21:11.737 --> 00:21:13.080
I'm not thirsty.

268
00:21:47.539 --> 00:21:51.954
I find you guys so easily.

269
00:21:55.147 --> 00:21:59.095
But I may not find her in this lifetime.

270
00:22:26.011 --> 00:22:31.017
<i>Missing child Lee Hye-ji</i>

271
00:22:35.253 --> 00:22:37.392
Ma'am!

272
00:22:37.689 --> 00:22:38.690
I'm here.

273
00:22:42.994 --> 00:22:45.133
Look at this house!

274
00:22:45.197 --> 00:22:47.040
Cassettes, matches...

275
00:22:47.632 --> 00:22:49.202
They're all antiques!

276
00:22:49.368 --> 00:22:52.212
This place is such a mess...

277
00:22:53.004 --> 00:22:56.474
It already looks like moving day.

278
00:22:58.110 --> 00:23:02.058
A Chinese guy wants to buy this house.

279
00:23:02.914 --> 00:23:05.049
I'll get you 4 times of what it's worth!

280
00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:06.050
4 times!

281
00:23:07.419 --> 00:23:10.054
What if your granddaughter returns?

282
00:23:10.055 --> 00:23:11.932
She'll be so shocked!

283
00:23:13.058 --> 00:23:16.198
I'm not selling my house,
so don't come again!

284
00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:19.630
Oops...

285
00:23:21.133 --> 00:23:22.908
It's so salty.

286
00:23:24.636 --> 00:23:28.982
I guess your kidneys are still healthy.

287
00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:31.577
She still has a temper, too.

288
00:23:31.643 --> 00:23:37.218
She said she won't sell
the house, so give up.

289
00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:39.553
Let's go catch the boat.

290
00:23:40.152 --> 00:23:44.191
I'm heading home, everyone!

291
00:23:44.256 --> 00:23:49.001
You're only strong inside the water.

292
00:23:49.728 --> 00:23:52.334
You're being too stubborn.

293
00:23:53.031 --> 00:23:54.704
Think of your age.

294
00:23:55.267 --> 00:23:59.079
Sell the house and use
the money to live comfortably.

295
00:23:59.171 --> 00:24:04.280
Then, where would Hye-ji come back to?

296
00:24:06.044 --> 00:24:08.490
She hasn't come back
to that house for years.

297
00:24:10.515 --> 00:24:13.018
Look, it's the dolphins...

298
00:24:13.718 --> 00:24:20.499
Dolphins, please make my wish come true.

299
00:24:20.559 --> 00:24:22.664
If dolphins granted wishes...

300
00:24:24.062 --> 00:24:25.700
I'd own a building.

301
00:24:28.066 --> 00:24:29.066
Thank you.

302
00:24:34.005 --> 00:24:36.042
When Hye-ji was young, her mother ran off.

303
00:24:37.108 --> 00:24:40.112
And her father died when she was a baby.

304
00:24:40.178 --> 00:24:42.124
Now, we don't know if she's alive or dead.

305
00:24:43.215 --> 00:24:48.085
It's because we're both unlucky.

306
00:24:48.086 --> 00:24:49.190
Don't say that.

307
00:24:49.454 --> 00:24:50.454
What?

308
00:24:50.522 --> 00:24:53.696
You have me and Myung-ok.

309
00:25:01.199 --> 00:25:04.112
Speak of the devil.

310
00:25:05.403 --> 00:25:07.576
What is it?

311
00:25:11.276 --> 00:25:12.277
Really?

312
00:25:15.046 --> 00:25:16.320
Are you sure?

313
00:25:18.149 --> 00:25:19.149
Okay!

314
00:25:19.784 --> 00:25:20.854
Ma'am!

315
00:25:21.319 --> 00:25:24.391
The dolphins granted your wish!

316
00:25:25.624 --> 00:25:26.624
Huh?

317
00:25:29.961 --> 00:25:31.729
Where is she?

318
00:25:31.730 --> 00:25:35.234
We brought Mrs. Hong...

319
00:25:35.300 --> 00:25:37.109
Over here, please.

320
00:25:37.302 --> 00:25:40.579
I'm Hong Gye-chun. Where's my grandchild?

321
00:25:40.639 --> 00:25:42.744
The person in charge is waiting for you.

322
00:25:42.807 --> 00:25:45.549
- We'll have to check...
- What?

323
00:25:45.610 --> 00:25:48.682
- If she's really your relative.
- Where is she?

324
00:25:48.780 --> 00:25:50.191
Are you Mrs. Hong?

325
00:25:50.549 --> 00:25:51.550
Follow me.

326
00:25:51.616 --> 00:25:53.118
Please read thoroughly

327
00:25:53.184 --> 00:25:55.562
and fill out the DNA test
application form.

328
00:25:56.688 --> 00:25:59.931
Was her mother's name Park Soo-hee?

329
00:25:59.991 --> 00:26:03.564
Yes, that's my daughter-in-law.

330
00:26:03.628 --> 00:26:06.507
She kidnapped Nam Hye-ji...

331
00:26:06.565 --> 00:26:07.565
What?

332
00:26:08.466 --> 00:26:10.275
Well, she took her.

333
00:26:10.335 --> 00:26:14.306
Right after Hye-ji disappeared,
she was registered to her family.

334
00:26:14.406 --> 00:26:18.946
But it says here that
Park Soo-hee is dead.

335
00:26:19.010 --> 00:26:21.581
According to Hye-ji, it was a car crash.

336
00:26:21.646 --> 00:26:25.992
Her stepfather gave up custody,
so she went to an orphanage.

337
00:26:26.084 --> 00:26:30.965
We searched the entire country
without knowing that!

338
00:26:31.022 --> 00:26:34.970
Please write your name
and leave a thumbprint.

339
00:26:35.026 --> 00:26:35.970
Here you go.

340
00:26:36.027 --> 00:26:40.064
We can't thank you enough.

341
00:26:40.065 --> 00:26:41.066
Not at all.

342
00:26:41.166 --> 00:26:44.079
- Thank you so much.
- Just wait for a while.

343
00:26:44.269 --> 00:26:45.304
Are you done?

344
00:26:45.370 --> 00:26:48.442
Leave that off at the clinic.

345
00:26:48.506 --> 00:26:51.180
- Okay, thank you.
- Please wait here.

346
00:26:54.079 --> 00:26:57.219
- Should we throw a party?
- Of course we should.

347
00:27:00.518 --> 00:27:02.429
Sorry to keep you waiting.

348
00:27:02.654 --> 00:27:03.962
Come on in.

349
00:27:23.541 --> 00:27:24.849
Hello.

350
00:27:41.192 --> 00:27:43.934
Are you really Hye-ji?

351
00:27:48.700 --> 00:27:50.702
You've grown so much.

352
00:27:55.040 --> 00:27:58.112
Look at that face.

353
00:28:05.984 --> 00:28:07.395
You still have this...

354
00:28:11.990 --> 00:28:15.437
Why didn't you look for me?

355
00:28:17.262 --> 00:28:21.108
Mom said that you died.

356
00:28:25.103 --> 00:28:29.142
You must have struggled so much.

357
00:28:32.711 --> 00:28:36.181
My baby... My grandchild...

358
00:28:40.685 --> 00:28:42.187
Everything's fine now.

359
00:28:43.088 --> 00:28:47.468
I found you. You're alive.

360
00:28:52.063 --> 00:28:54.236
Let's take a picture.

361
00:28:54.399 --> 00:28:55.241
Come to the center.

362
00:28:55.366 --> 00:28:57.642
Shouldn't we be in the picture, too?

363
00:28:57.769 --> 00:28:58.679
No!

364
00:28:58.737 --> 00:28:59.909
More to the right.

365
00:28:59.971 --> 00:29:01.314
No no, that way

366
00:29:01.372 --> 00:29:02.612
to the other side.

367
00:29:04.976 --> 00:29:06.649
- Smile.
- I'll take the picture.

368
00:29:07.078 --> 00:29:08.421
Three, two, one!

369
00:29:09.447 --> 00:29:12.860
This house feels cozy
now that Hye-ji's back.

370
00:29:14.219 --> 00:29:16.199
Let's invite the neighbors.

371
00:29:16.254 --> 00:29:20.066
It's been ages since I've you smile!

372
00:29:20.125 --> 00:29:23.334
Why are you preparing dinner so early?

373
00:29:23.394 --> 00:29:28.901
Hye-ji your grandma is
cooking tilefish for you!

374
00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:30.035
Go away.

375
00:29:31.002 --> 00:29:32.003
Ow!

376
00:29:32.470 --> 00:29:35.383
- I want to help.
- No, no.

377
00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:38.284
Get inside, sweetie.

378
00:29:38.343 --> 00:29:39.549
Go in, some rest.

379
00:29:42.046 --> 00:29:43.992
Look at that smile!

380
00:29:44.048 --> 00:29:45.288
Are you that happy?

381
00:29:48.286 --> 00:29:51.165
Your wish came true!

382
00:29:51.222 --> 00:29:54.032
- You're right.
- Hye-ji came back.

383
00:29:54.092 --> 00:29:57.060
The Sea God must really exist!

384
00:29:57.061 --> 00:29:59.098
Of course he does.

385
00:30:01.032 --> 00:30:02.306
This proves it.

386
00:30:02.734 --> 00:30:06.045
I think the Sea God must really exist.

387
00:30:18.183 --> 00:30:21.164
Did you still have that?

388
00:30:23.054 --> 00:30:25.364
- Here, eat this.
- Thank you.

389
00:30:28.092 --> 00:30:30.629
I let go of your hand.

390
00:30:31.563 --> 00:30:34.169
I wanted to buy nice things for you.

391
00:30:35.366 --> 00:30:38.210
But I got carried away.

392
00:30:40.405 --> 00:30:44.478
From now on, we'll be happy.

393
00:30:47.645 --> 00:30:52.560
Let's all drink up to
celebrate Hye-ji's return!

394
00:30:52.617 --> 00:30:57.464
Mrs. Hong suffered so
much for all these years!

395
00:30:57.622 --> 00:30:59.966
You can't even tell that she's an elderly!

396
00:31:00.091 --> 00:31:01.968
That's right.

397
00:31:02.026 --> 00:31:07.271
Mrs. Hong will finally be
able to sleep well!

398
00:31:07.332 --> 00:31:08.402
You're right.

399
00:31:09.267 --> 00:31:12.578
I can't believe this day is finally here.

400
00:31:13.037 --> 00:31:18.009
She looks just like her grandma!

401
00:31:20.044 --> 00:31:22.024
Look at her eat!

402
00:31:22.247 --> 00:31:23.419
Is it good?

403
00:31:25.049 --> 00:31:26.528
You should eat, too.

404
00:31:26.584 --> 00:31:28.427
She's the same age as Han!

405
00:31:28.486 --> 00:31:30.625
You used to play together.

406
00:31:30.688 --> 00:31:33.726
You should be in high school!

407
00:31:34.092 --> 00:31:35.400
Stop running around!

408
00:31:37.061 --> 00:31:45.037
Do you remember the black pig
that lived near the outhouse?

409
00:31:46.104 --> 00:31:47.708
- Toya.
- Toya!

410
00:31:50.074 --> 00:31:51.576
She remembers Toya!

411
00:31:51.643 --> 00:31:56.023
- This is all so sad.
- Don't be sad!

412
00:31:56.080 --> 00:31:57.491
Hye-ji, Hye-ji!

413
00:31:58.249 --> 00:32:01.287
Ma'am, where's Hye-ji?

414
00:32:01.352 --> 00:32:04.458
Hye-ji, I waited so
long for you to return!

415
00:32:04.522 --> 00:32:08.664
Weren't you shocked at
the sight of this house?

416
00:32:08.726 --> 00:32:10.467
- Just sell it...
- Stop it!

417
00:32:10.528 --> 00:32:12.439
She's just arrived!

418
00:32:12.497 --> 00:32:15.103
Don't bring the house up!

419
00:32:15.166 --> 00:32:16.474
Just drink up and leave.

420
00:32:16.534 --> 00:32:19.344
Don't be like that. Here, drink this.

421
00:32:20.505 --> 00:32:21.506
Ma'am...

422
00:32:21.572 --> 00:32:23.677
Let's all drink together!

423
00:32:24.309 --> 00:32:27.722
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

424
00:32:48.232 --> 00:32:49.232
Oh!

425
00:33:14.492 --> 00:33:15.493
Are you pooping?

426
00:33:16.060 --> 00:33:18.336
You should have woken me up.

427
00:33:21.232 --> 00:33:24.975
Let's buy a toilet tomorrow morning!

428
00:33:44.489 --> 00:33:46.901
I washed your clothes, so just wear that.

429
00:33:47.358 --> 00:33:49.463
Let's go someplace after having breakfast.

430
00:33:49.527 --> 00:33:51.200
In these clothes?

431
00:33:51.462 --> 00:33:53.533
You look great!

432
00:33:59.203 --> 00:34:01.342
What do you think of this one?

433
00:34:01.406 --> 00:34:03.408
This comforter is thinner.

434
00:34:05.676 --> 00:34:07.155
I'll pack this one.

435
00:34:09.414 --> 00:34:10.757
It's for my granddaughter.

436
00:34:12.050 --> 00:34:13.393
She doesn't like it.

437
00:34:25.363 --> 00:34:27.172
Try this.

438
00:34:30.001 --> 00:34:32.038
This one's pretty. You look like a doll!

439
00:34:35.139 --> 00:34:36.139
You like it?

440
00:35:11.075 --> 00:35:17.356
<i>The guy didn't die, but
the motel owner wants money.</i>

441
00:35:17.482 --> 00:35:18.552
Money?

442
00:35:18.616 --> 00:35:21.358
<i>Or he'll tell the police.</i>

443
00:35:21.986 --> 00:35:25.524
<i>Chul-heon and Chung-hee
are trying to frame you.</i>

444
00:35:26.124 --> 00:35:30.334
<i>So, just stay there.</i>

445
00:35:30.394 --> 00:35:33.204
- I'm out of coins.
- <i>Call me again!</i>

446
00:35:43.941 --> 00:35:46.114
Don't step on that!

447
00:35:46.177 --> 00:35:50.626
Can't you see the ground?
Everything will be ruined!

448
00:35:51.149 --> 00:35:53.390
Get away from here! Don't step on it!

449
00:35:53.451 --> 00:35:56.022
- Hello, ma'am.
- Oh, it's you.

450
00:35:56.154 --> 00:35:58.293
Han, how have you been?

451
00:36:01.225 --> 00:36:04.900
Take her away, or she'll
step on everything!

452
00:36:06.164 --> 00:36:07.370
You can't go this way.

453
00:36:07.431 --> 00:36:09.502
Do you not understand what I am saying?

454
00:36:11.402 --> 00:36:13.040
- I'll be off.
- Good bye.

455
00:36:22.013 --> 00:36:24.425
You're Hye-ji, right?

456
00:36:26.250 --> 00:36:27.388
Do you know me?

457
00:36:28.553 --> 00:36:31.329
Everyone in this town knows you.

458
00:36:31.956 --> 00:36:33.026
I'm Han.

459
00:36:35.493 --> 00:36:37.666
Stop bothering me and go your way.

460
00:36:41.065 --> 00:36:42.066
Want a ride home?

461
00:37:19.237 --> 00:37:20.648
What's that sound?

462
00:37:22.340 --> 00:37:23.978
The divers are gasping for air.

463
00:37:24.275 --> 00:37:25.982
Your grandmother will be there, too.

464
00:37:26.611 --> 00:37:27.817
Gasping for air?

465
00:37:28.479 --> 00:37:29.480
Yeah.

466
00:37:29.580 --> 00:37:33.392
They hold their breath
for a really long time.

467
00:37:34.118 --> 00:37:36.655
We'd probably die.

468
00:37:46.631 --> 00:37:48.736
Why won't this open?

469
00:37:49.166 --> 00:37:50.645
I'm taking a bath.

470
00:37:50.701 --> 00:37:52.510
I know, but...

471
00:37:52.570 --> 00:37:53.981
Why won't this door open?

472
00:37:54.038 --> 00:37:55.984
I'm taking a bath!

473
00:37:56.040 --> 00:37:57.986
I know, I'm not deaf!

474
00:37:58.042 --> 00:37:59.612
Is the door broken?

475
00:38:00.978 --> 00:38:04.585
- I locked the door.
- Why did you do that?

476
00:38:04.649 --> 00:38:07.459
Open it so I can get the dishes.

477
00:38:09.153 --> 00:38:10.223
Hold on.

478
00:38:14.091 --> 00:38:20.975
You don't need to lock
the door when you bathe.

479
00:38:24.368 --> 00:38:26.678
You're all grown up, huh?

480
00:38:36.647 --> 00:38:38.627
We have a new student.

481
00:38:40.017 --> 00:38:41.360
Introduce yourself.

482
00:38:44.055 --> 00:38:46.433
I haven't been to
school in a while.

483
00:38:47.091 --> 00:38:49.093
Don't give me any trouble.

484
00:38:51.362 --> 00:38:52.670
I'll take any empty seat.

485
00:38:59.770 --> 00:39:01.943
Don't bully the new kid, okay?

486
00:39:02.006 --> 00:39:04.486
- Yes, sir.
- I'll be watching you.

487
00:39:04.642 --> 00:39:05.642
Yes, sir.

488
00:39:08.179 --> 00:39:10.489
- Change seats with me.
- Why?

489
00:39:10.548 --> 00:39:12.960
- I'll buy you a snack.
- Okay.

490
00:39:19.123 --> 00:39:20.534
Do you have the textbook?

491
00:39:23.027 --> 00:39:27.134
Hye-ji is a full-grown lady now!

492
00:39:28.199 --> 00:39:31.942
I still see her as a child.

493
00:39:32.503 --> 00:39:35.484
But all I do now is prepare her meals.

494
00:39:36.674 --> 00:39:40.349
At your age, you shouldn't
be changing diapers.

495
00:39:40.478 --> 00:39:41.548
Oh, right.

496
00:39:42.279 --> 00:39:44.156
Who's Hye-ji's teacher?

497
00:39:44.215 --> 00:39:47.526
He's a well-known artist.

498
00:39:48.619 --> 00:39:51.930
He doesn't really look like one.

499
00:39:52.022 --> 00:39:52.966
Huh?

500
00:39:53.023 --> 00:39:55.003
Free topic

501
00:39:56.727 --> 00:39:57.797
Here.

502
00:39:58.396 --> 00:40:02.640
Draw whatever you want to today.

503
00:40:02.733 --> 00:40:03.734
Yes, sir.

504
00:40:04.001 --> 00:40:05.173
Start!

505
00:40:19.150 --> 00:40:20.185
What's this?

506
00:40:22.453 --> 00:40:25.593
Have you expressed the
beauty of empty space?

507
00:40:25.656 --> 00:40:28.000
Or your free spirit?

508
00:40:28.058 --> 00:40:29.594
I didn't know what to draw.

509
00:40:29.660 --> 00:40:34.006
Draw anything that come to your mind.

510
00:40:34.098 --> 00:40:35.372
Is that so hard?

511
00:40:38.502 --> 00:40:39.708
Do you want me out?

512
00:40:53.317 --> 00:40:54.317
Lee Hye-ji.

513
00:40:56.387 --> 00:41:02.133
I'll give you all the time you need.

514
00:41:02.626 --> 00:41:07.974
You can't leave until
you've finished your picture.

515
00:41:09.133 --> 00:41:10.133
Start drawing.

516
00:41:25.182 --> 00:41:26.456
Lee Hye-ji.

517
00:41:28.986 --> 00:41:31.466
You're really stubborn.

518
00:41:31.522 --> 00:41:33.160
Just go home, then.

519
00:41:34.058 --> 00:41:38.006
Why did she have to come here?

520
00:41:38.062 --> 00:41:39.006
You!

521
00:41:39.063 --> 00:41:40.063
Go home!

522
00:42:16.133 --> 00:42:18.670
Why are you still here?

523
00:42:22.606 --> 00:42:23.949
I'm done.

524
00:42:24.542 --> 00:42:25.612
Happy?

525
00:42:30.314 --> 00:42:31.314
Hye-ji!

526
00:42:48.065 --> 00:42:49.601
That girl...

527
00:43:07.184 --> 00:43:11.155
Why hasn't she come home yet?

528
00:43:11.221 --> 00:43:12.221
Hye-ji!

529
00:43:12.256 --> 00:43:13.326
Your grandma.

530
00:43:15.759 --> 00:43:17.067
Hye-ji!

531
00:43:17.428 --> 00:43:19.135
I'm home.

532
00:43:19.363 --> 00:43:21.206
Did you study hard?

533
00:43:22.066 --> 00:43:23.067
Where's your backpack?

534
00:43:24.034 --> 00:43:27.015
- I left it at school.
- It's alright.

535
00:43:28.505 --> 00:43:31.281
You might as well.
It's so heavy.

536
00:43:31.442 --> 00:43:32.978
You're going back tomorrow anyway.

537
00:43:33.043 --> 00:43:34.113
Let's eat dinner.

538
00:43:35.045 --> 00:43:36.547
You must be hungry.

539
00:43:39.750 --> 00:43:41.058
Come on out!

540
00:43:41.585 --> 00:43:42.585
Okay.

541
00:43:46.557 --> 00:43:49.401
Eat up.

542
00:43:51.095 --> 00:43:52.165
Oh, dear...

543
00:43:58.402 --> 00:43:59.402
Hold on.

544
00:44:06.043 --> 00:44:07.454
I'll eat it myself.

545
00:44:07.511 --> 00:44:09.013
No. Go ahead.

546
00:44:10.080 --> 00:44:11.081
Go on.

547
00:44:13.150 --> 00:44:14.754
That's it.

548
00:44:37.007 --> 00:44:38.007
To the right!

549
00:44:39.076 --> 00:44:40.419
Rotate your arms!

550
00:44:40.511 --> 00:44:42.320
That's it!

551
00:44:42.579 --> 00:44:46.755
Make waves with your arms!

552
00:44:47.017 --> 00:44:52.365
Will Hye-ji be more comfortable
if moved to an apartment?

553
00:44:52.456 --> 00:44:55.494
She's all you ever think about.

554
00:44:55.726 --> 00:44:59.731
You could fix your house
to make it more comfortable.

555
00:45:00.297 --> 00:45:02.504
I don't have money to fix the house.

556
00:45:03.300 --> 00:45:06.577
But if I sell the house,
I'll get a lot of money.

557
00:45:08.172 --> 00:45:10.812
You love her way too much!

558
00:45:12.176 --> 00:45:15.123
Work your side muscles!

559
00:45:15.179 --> 00:45:18.160
The wind is dying down.

560
00:45:19.349 --> 00:45:24.196
Let's go diving!

561
00:45:24.621 --> 00:45:26.328
The wind is dying down!

562
00:45:26.390 --> 00:45:27.960
Churn the butter!

563
00:45:28.025 --> 00:45:29.732
Let's go work!

564
00:45:29.993 --> 00:45:32.735
Wait, everyone...

565
00:45:41.338 --> 00:45:42.612
Put it over there.

566
00:45:44.174 --> 00:45:45.174
Hey!

567
00:45:45.409 --> 00:45:50.154
I'll let you skip class
if you join the art club.

568
00:45:50.447 --> 00:45:53.485
That's why they joined, too.

569
00:45:57.154 --> 00:45:59.464
You don't know what to draw?

570
00:45:59.690 --> 00:46:02.330
Draw this bald guy first.

571
00:46:03.093 --> 00:46:04.093
Huh?

572
00:46:04.261 --> 00:46:05.296
Start by sketching.

573
00:46:29.419 --> 00:46:30.419
Hey...

574
00:46:31.421 --> 00:46:34.800
You're not scribbling in your notebook!

575
00:46:36.727 --> 00:46:37.899
I quit.

576
00:46:39.363 --> 00:46:40.967
- Hey.
- What?

577
00:46:41.064 --> 00:46:45.206
Drawing out here is
better than attending class.

578
00:46:46.703 --> 00:46:48.444
But go if you want to.

579
00:47:06.156 --> 00:47:08.033
Mrs. Hong!

580
00:47:08.525 --> 00:47:09.469
You're here.

581
00:47:09.526 --> 00:47:11.233
- Sit down.
- Okay.

582
00:47:14.164 --> 00:47:17.145
- Where's your granddaughter?
- She's studying, so be quiet.

583
00:47:19.303 --> 00:47:22.672
You didn't budge for months,
but you'll do anything for her.

584
00:47:22.673 --> 00:47:24.778
Be quiet and just hand it over.

585
00:47:27.744 --> 00:47:29.690
Stamp your name here.

586
00:47:33.417 --> 00:47:36.489
I'll transfer you the money
first thing tomorrow morning.

587
00:47:37.020 --> 00:47:39.000
You sealed the deal!

588
00:47:42.059 --> 00:47:43.129
How wonderful!

589
00:47:46.129 --> 00:47:47.665
Much better!

590
00:47:50.734 --> 00:47:52.407
How am I supposed to draw that?

591
00:47:52.502 --> 00:47:56.109
Get every wrinkle exactly right.

592
00:47:59.743 --> 00:48:01.279
What do you need to draw?

593
00:48:01.745 --> 00:48:05.022
Niobe, of course.

594
00:48:05.182 --> 00:48:07.219
You delinquent.

595
00:48:08.418 --> 00:48:13.128
What you need to draw is the light.

596
00:48:13.657 --> 00:48:15.000
Look over there.

597
00:48:17.494 --> 00:48:18.564
Now, look at that.

598
00:48:20.664 --> 00:48:24.134
If you want to be a good artist,
don't focus on the shadows.

599
00:48:25.535 --> 00:48:27.276
Focus on the light.

600
00:48:33.510 --> 00:48:34.510
Hye-ji!

601
00:48:37.714 --> 00:48:39.193
Want to see something cool?

602
00:49:06.009 --> 00:49:07.215
Isn't it nice?

603
00:49:11.315 --> 00:49:12.658
Why are you doing this?

604
00:49:14.184 --> 00:49:15.663
I just feel a connection.

605
00:49:17.621 --> 00:49:18.621
And...

606
00:49:20.657 --> 00:49:21.863
You're pretty.

607
00:49:28.999 --> 00:49:30.000
This is making me sleepy.

608
00:49:30.100 --> 00:49:31.340
Don't you have any other song?

609
00:49:52.189 --> 00:49:53.725
Sorry about that.

610
00:49:57.327 --> 00:49:58.407
Do you want to make a call?

611
00:50:08.638 --> 00:50:09.638
Hello?

612
00:50:10.140 --> 00:50:11.140
<i>Min-hee.</i>

613
00:50:11.475 --> 00:50:12.475
Hye-ji?

614
00:50:16.546 --> 00:50:17.581
Hello?

615
00:50:18.315 --> 00:50:19.453
<i>Who is this?</i>

616
00:50:20.984 --> 00:50:22.588
Hye-ji, it's me.

617
00:50:23.053 --> 00:50:24.589
You can't just disappear like that.

618
00:50:24.654 --> 00:50:25.724
Put Min-hee on the phone.

619
00:50:26.690 --> 00:50:28.727
Min-hee is kind of busy.

620
00:50:28.959 --> 00:50:31.269
- Be quiet!
- <i>What are you doing?</i>

621
00:50:32.162 --> 00:50:33.607
<i>It's not what you think.</i>

622
00:50:33.663 --> 00:50:35.506
<i>He's asking for a settlement.</i>

623
00:50:35.565 --> 00:50:37.545
<i>We're hoping you could
come up with the money.</i>

624
00:50:38.502 --> 00:50:41.415
Your only friend's life is on the line.

625
00:50:42.205 --> 00:50:43.616
Don't you lay a finger on her.

626
00:50:45.742 --> 00:50:47.517
Otherwise I will kill you.

627
00:50:50.247 --> 00:50:52.386
You're being unreasonable.

628
00:50:53.216 --> 00:50:55.457
Anyway, we don't have much time.

629
00:50:55.519 --> 00:50:58.159
Get me the money or

630
00:50:58.221 --> 00:51:00.701
I'm going to pimp Min-hee.

631
00:51:04.127 --> 00:51:06.698
You should have told me
right away when she called.

632
00:51:09.332 --> 00:51:10.402
What am I going to do?

633
00:51:13.303 --> 00:51:16.284
Stop talking nonsense
and get back to work!

634
00:51:16.339 --> 00:51:21.550
Hye-ji is disrespectful
and she wears short skirts!

635
00:51:21.611 --> 00:51:24.114
Isn't she a delinquent?

636
00:51:24.181 --> 00:51:26.422
It's just fashion!

637
00:51:26.483 --> 00:51:29.464
You were like that when
you were young, too!

638
00:51:29.519 --> 00:51:31.999
- Be quiet!
- But...

639
00:51:32.055 --> 00:51:35.127
I know you love Hye-ji.

640
00:51:35.258 --> 00:51:38.296
But people saw her smoking cigarettes!

641
00:51:38.361 --> 00:51:39.704
Did you see it with your own eyes?

642
00:51:39.763 --> 00:51:42.539
Yes, I saw it once!

643
00:51:42.599 --> 00:51:45.102
They're just rumors!

644
00:51:45.168 --> 00:51:46.613
Hye-ji is...

645
00:51:46.670 --> 00:51:51.244
When she was gone, you all
told me she'd be doing fine!

646
00:51:51.308 --> 00:51:52.548
That's right!

647
00:51:52.609 --> 00:51:56.284
You should help her lead a
good life now that she's back!

648
00:51:56.346 --> 00:51:58.087
What is all the fuss?

649
00:51:59.516 --> 00:52:00.517
What do you think?

650
00:52:02.152 --> 00:52:03.153
About what?

651
00:52:03.687 --> 00:52:06.327
About your drawings.

652
00:52:08.258 --> 00:52:10.238
- They're nice.
- Really?

653
00:52:11.495 --> 00:52:16.501
I'm giving you special lessons
because I like your wild side.

654
00:52:16.733 --> 00:52:17.575
Hey.

655
00:52:17.701 --> 00:52:20.614
But you have no personal style!

656
00:52:21.571 --> 00:52:23.517
I guess I'm not talented.

657
00:52:26.109 --> 00:52:27.452
I don't want to learn art.

658
00:52:27.744 --> 00:52:29.087
Lee Hye-ji...

659
00:52:31.414 --> 00:52:33.985
Why do you have to make life so difficult?

660
00:52:35.252 --> 00:52:37.232
Never mind.

661
00:52:38.355 --> 00:52:41.302
You'd better take these back.

662
00:52:43.293 --> 00:52:47.537
Your grandmother asked
me to teach you art,

663
00:52:47.597 --> 00:52:50.476
so that you'd enjoy life. She gave me

664
00:52:51.468 --> 00:52:54.039
bracken, seaweed...

665
00:52:55.338 --> 00:52:56.578
Ginseng liquor...

666
00:53:00.377 --> 00:53:03.449
I know you had a hard life.

667
00:53:04.247 --> 00:53:07.490
It might strengthen or weaken you.

668
00:53:08.084 --> 00:53:10.086
It's all up to you.

669
00:53:11.087 --> 00:53:14.068
If your grandmother is this devoted...

670
00:53:14.558 --> 00:53:16.560
You should at least try.

671
00:53:27.737 --> 00:53:28.737
Ni hao!

672
00:53:29.139 --> 00:53:31.119
Ms.Yang, get him a cup of coffee.

673
00:53:31.641 --> 00:53:34.520
I have something to ask you.

674
00:53:35.278 --> 00:53:36.552
He's not Chinese.

675
00:53:36.613 --> 00:53:37.819
Please sit down.

676
00:53:38.615 --> 00:53:41.186
Sir, it's a wasting time.

677
00:53:42.552 --> 00:53:45.260
Here is the best.

678
00:53:46.356 --> 00:53:49.599
Grudge, grudge.

679
00:54:06.076 --> 00:54:10.491
They're asking the Sea God for protection.

680
00:54:10.547 --> 00:54:11.547
Hye-ji!

681
00:54:12.415 --> 00:54:13.894
Let's go over there.

682
00:54:13.950 --> 00:54:15.452
There's no need to be scared.

683
00:54:31.801 --> 00:54:32.609
Hye-ji!

684
00:54:32.669 --> 00:54:34.103
Where are you going?

685
00:54:34.104 --> 00:54:36.106
Come here.

686
00:55:14.744 --> 00:55:16.052
Sea God...

687
00:55:17.981 --> 00:55:23.021
Please have pity on my granddaughter

688
00:55:23.086 --> 00:55:27.034
and help her lead a good life.

689
00:55:27.223 --> 00:55:32.468
Please help her... Please help her...

690
00:55:33.463 --> 00:55:34.464
<i>Hong Gye-chun Bankbook</i>

691
00:55:40.737 --> 00:55:42.216
What am I doing?

692
00:55:45.308 --> 00:55:47.549
Are you sure you looked everywhere?

693
00:55:47.610 --> 00:55:49.021
Of course.

694
00:55:52.115 --> 00:55:55.653
There's no sign of a break-in.

695
00:55:55.719 --> 00:55:58.063
Then, where did it go?

696
00:55:58.121 --> 00:56:01.432
Are you sure you left it there?

697
00:56:01.491 --> 00:56:03.471
Try to remember.

698
00:56:03.526 --> 00:56:04.971
Come in and have dinner!

699
00:56:05.662 --> 00:56:08.541
- You can go now.
- Yes, ma'am.

700
00:56:08.598 --> 00:56:09.633
Good bye.

701
00:56:10.667 --> 00:56:13.170
I'll not let him go if I catch him.

702
00:56:14.204 --> 00:56:15.204
Miss...

703
00:56:15.505 --> 00:56:17.507
Have you seen anyone suspicious around?

704
00:56:19.075 --> 00:56:20.110
I guess not.

705
00:56:21.010 --> 00:56:22.010
See you.

706
00:56:25.081 --> 00:56:30.053
How did someone find out
there's money in the house?

707
00:56:31.254 --> 00:56:32.961
- Honey!
- Yeah?

708
00:56:33.089 --> 00:56:34.397
Her money is gone?

709
00:56:34.457 --> 00:56:38.132
She says that 1.5 million won
vanished from her cupboard.

710
00:56:38.361 --> 00:56:39.499
The cupboard?

711
00:56:41.197 --> 00:56:47.273
Didn't you lend 1.5 million
won to the neighbor's son?

712
00:56:47.337 --> 00:56:49.681
You took it out of your cupboard.

713
00:56:51.608 --> 00:56:52.951
That's right.

714
00:56:53.009 --> 00:56:56.456
Old age is making you forgetful!

715
00:56:56.513 --> 00:56:58.459
Stop it.

716
00:56:58.615 --> 00:56:59.685
Case solved!

717
00:57:01.050 --> 00:57:02.222
Oh, dear...

718
00:57:09.092 --> 00:57:11.072
- What are you doing?
- Huh?

719
00:57:13.430 --> 00:57:15.034
Well...

720
00:57:18.067 --> 00:57:20.069
I have an insect bite.

721
00:57:20.670 --> 00:57:21.671
I see.

722
00:57:24.707 --> 00:57:26.277
There are a lot of insects here.

723
00:57:49.299 --> 00:57:50.972
What are you doing?

724
00:57:51.134 --> 00:57:52.636
You scared me!

725
00:57:52.702 --> 00:57:54.704
Why are you so surprised?

726
00:57:56.506 --> 00:57:59.919
Let's have a word inside.

727
00:57:59.976 --> 00:58:01.182
Just do it here.

728
00:58:02.445 --> 00:58:08.987
You shouldn't use birthdays
as your bankbook passcode.

729
00:58:09.118 --> 00:58:11.621
Mine is the day Hye-ji disappeared.

730
00:58:12.455 --> 00:58:15.868
Hye-ji might figure it out, so change it.

731
00:58:15.992 --> 00:58:17.630
So what if Hye-ji knows?

732
00:58:19.028 --> 00:58:22.703
Well, I just saw...

733
00:58:23.132 --> 00:58:24.202
What?

734
00:58:25.101 --> 00:58:26.603
Never mind.

735
00:58:26.703 --> 00:58:28.011
Tell me!

736
00:58:29.072 --> 00:58:36.012
From now on, make a record
of all money transactions!

737
00:58:36.079 --> 00:58:40.323
And stop saying yes to every single favor.

738
00:58:41.017 --> 00:58:42.017
Fine.

739
00:58:51.294 --> 00:58:53.331
- I'm leaving.
- Bye.

740
00:59:04.674 --> 00:59:06.950
Give me one.

741
00:59:23.993 --> 00:59:25.028
Hye-ji...

742
00:59:27.163 --> 00:59:30.337
Which is bigger, the sea or the sky?

743
00:59:32.635 --> 00:59:34.171
The sky, of course.

744
00:59:36.139 --> 00:59:39.052
I guess you're all grown up.

745
00:59:50.353 --> 00:59:53.357
Even when life is hard...

746
00:59:56.125 --> 01:00:02.098
If someone's on your side,
it's possible to go on.

747
01:00:04.100 --> 01:00:11.075
I'm on your side, so live
however you want to.

748
01:00:17.480 --> 01:00:18.788
I'll...

749
01:00:20.249 --> 01:00:22.320
take care of everything.

750
01:00:59.722 --> 01:01:01.429
Hey, you delinquent.

751
01:01:02.692 --> 01:01:05.138
Who gives you inspiration?

752
01:01:07.230 --> 01:01:09.005
Inspiration?

753
01:01:09.098 --> 01:01:10.543
Draw that person.

754
01:01:12.602 --> 01:01:16.049
Are you going to quit again?

755
01:01:17.106 --> 01:01:18.346
I'll give it a try.

756
01:01:21.044 --> 01:01:22.044
Good.

757
01:01:22.378 --> 01:01:23.482
Sir...

758
01:01:24.380 --> 01:01:25.484
Yeah?

759
01:01:28.217 --> 01:01:30.060
What is it?

760
01:01:30.153 --> 01:01:31.723
Can you...

761
01:01:35.258 --> 01:01:37.499
Confess something with a drawing?

762
01:01:39.729 --> 01:01:40.729
Hey...

763
01:01:44.067 --> 01:01:45.375
Do you have a crush on me?

764
01:01:46.169 --> 01:01:47.169
Huh?

765
01:01:48.237 --> 01:01:50.114
You silly girl.

766
01:01:53.309 --> 01:01:57.018
Turn off the radio if
you can't concentrate.

767
01:01:57.113 --> 01:01:58.217
That's okay.

768
01:02:06.255 --> 01:02:08.064
Why do you screw up your eyes?

769
01:02:08.491 --> 01:02:09.435
You'll get wrinkles.

770
01:02:09.492 --> 01:02:11.494
Because the sunlight is bright.

771
01:02:11.561 --> 01:02:13.234
Don't you have sunglasses?

772
01:02:13.763 --> 01:02:17.973
Blind people wear sunglasses.

773
01:02:18.101 --> 01:02:21.207
Did you wear sunblock
to protect your skin?

774
01:02:22.371 --> 01:02:24.112
I've lived so long that...

775
01:02:25.274 --> 01:02:27.550
My baby is nagging me.

776
01:02:39.555 --> 01:02:44.402
Why are you using so much of it?

777
01:02:45.128 --> 01:02:47.130
A small amount doesn't work.

778
01:02:55.004 --> 01:02:56.004
Wow...

779
01:02:57.140 --> 01:02:59.677
My grandchild is taking care of me.

780
01:03:00.409 --> 01:03:04.983
Wear sunblock when
you're working outdoors.

781
01:03:08.050 --> 01:03:12.396
We should let it sink into your skin.

782
01:03:13.489 --> 01:03:14.991
Like this.

783
01:03:16.559 --> 01:03:18.163
I applied too much.

784
01:03:20.096 --> 01:03:22.633
Use half of this amount.

785
01:03:25.201 --> 01:03:28.336
How far do we have to go?

786
01:03:28.337 --> 01:03:30.078
Shut up and follow me.

787
01:03:43.619 --> 01:03:45.997
Just imagine.

788
01:03:46.055 --> 01:03:50.026
Without light, this place
would be dark all the time.

789
01:03:50.426 --> 01:03:52.167
How sad would that be?

790
01:03:55.097 --> 01:04:00.137
You should use darker colors
for the trees over there.

791
01:04:00.269 --> 01:04:01.748
This part should be lighter.

792
01:04:03.072 --> 01:04:05.052
Paint the clouds, too.

793
01:04:05.408 --> 01:04:09.948
It's not perfect, but
you portrayed light well.

794
01:04:10.012 --> 01:04:11.184
Here you go.

795
01:04:22.091 --> 01:04:23.297
Grandma!

796
01:04:29.498 --> 01:04:30.499
Grandma?

797
01:04:31.601 --> 01:04:34.104
Oh, it's you.

798
01:04:34.170 --> 01:04:35.649
What are you doing here?

799
01:04:37.406 --> 01:04:40.353
I should go diving.

800
01:04:41.077 --> 01:04:42.420
Take me with you.

801
01:04:42.478 --> 01:04:43.684
No way!

802
01:04:43.746 --> 01:04:47.717
I won't let you become a diver!

803
01:04:49.118 --> 01:04:50.597
All right.

804
01:04:52.188 --> 01:04:54.190
But there's another way.

805
01:04:54.423 --> 01:04:57.267
I have it all figured out.

806
01:05:00.162 --> 01:05:02.301
Here, wear this.

807
01:05:04.200 --> 01:05:06.111
Will you be okay?

808
01:05:06.202 --> 01:05:08.045
I have all this equipment.

809
01:05:08.104 --> 01:05:11.306
Don't let go of my hand.

810
01:05:11.307 --> 01:05:12.308
Okay.

811
01:06:05.194 --> 01:06:07.140
Don't you like it?

812
01:06:07.463 --> 01:06:08.965
Did you really draw this?

813
01:06:09.031 --> 01:06:10.977
Who else would have drawn it?

814
01:06:17.373 --> 01:06:18.579
Wow...

815
01:06:20.309 --> 01:06:21.549
This is...

816
01:06:24.313 --> 01:06:26.054
Really good.

817
01:06:28.050 --> 01:06:31.031
You should enter this
art contest in Seoul.

818
01:06:32.655 --> 01:06:33.656
Take a look.

819
01:06:35.992 --> 01:06:37.562
This is great.

820
01:06:40.429 --> 01:06:44.138
Is it really good?

821
01:06:45.134 --> 01:06:46.442
Of course it is!

822
01:06:46.502 --> 01:06:48.345
I don't give out fake compliments!

823
01:06:56.345 --> 01:06:57.619
You'll enter, right?

824
01:06:57.713 --> 01:06:58.748
Let's do it.

825
01:06:59.715 --> 01:07:01.217
I'll enter.

826
01:07:08.991 --> 01:07:10.436
I have something to ask you.

827
01:07:15.931 --> 01:07:16.931
Never mind.

828
01:07:18.067 --> 01:07:19.137
What is it?

829
01:07:19.568 --> 01:07:21.309
Let's talk about it later.

830
01:07:24.573 --> 01:07:25.574
Hye-ji.

831
01:07:31.080 --> 01:07:32.184
You go ahead.

832
01:07:33.015 --> 01:07:35.120
- Who is that?
- Just go!

833
01:07:40.156 --> 01:07:41.294
It's so nice here.

834
01:07:43.459 --> 01:07:44.938
How did you find me?

835
01:07:52.301 --> 01:07:54.076
You abandoned me.

836
01:07:56.639 --> 01:07:59.210
You're right. I'm sorry.

837
01:08:05.081 --> 01:08:06.081
Could you...

838
01:08:09.051 --> 01:08:10.962
Get me some money?

839
01:08:14.256 --> 01:08:15.633
Are you still at it?

840
01:08:17.059 --> 01:08:18.333
I borrowed some money.

841
01:08:18.394 --> 01:08:20.396
Why would I have money?

842
01:08:24.033 --> 01:08:26.240
The down payment for your house.

843
01:08:26.569 --> 01:08:28.515
What are you saying?

844
01:08:30.039 --> 01:08:31.985
You want me to become a thief?

845
01:08:35.177 --> 01:08:36.656
Not at all.

846
01:08:40.649 --> 01:08:42.026
Then...

847
01:08:44.220 --> 01:08:47.429
I'll have to ask her myself.

848
01:08:47.490 --> 01:08:48.628
Are you crazy?

849
01:08:48.724 --> 01:08:51.102
Stay away from my grandmother!

850
01:08:56.499 --> 01:08:57.705
Your grandmother?

851
01:09:01.303 --> 01:09:02.373
Then...

852
01:09:03.539 --> 01:09:05.576
Just tell me where the bankbook is.

853
01:09:09.979 --> 01:09:10.979
Hey.

854
01:09:11.147 --> 01:09:13.684
Don't be like this.

855
01:09:15.050 --> 01:09:17.257
I'm on the verge here!

856
01:09:21.323 --> 01:09:24.600
Hye-ji, what are you doing there?

857
01:09:25.327 --> 01:09:26.328
Grandma...

858
01:09:27.696 --> 01:09:32.236
I was at school drawing.

859
01:09:33.702 --> 01:09:36.615
- I'll show you.
- Okay.

860
01:09:38.240 --> 01:09:43.986
When you were young, people's faces
looked like squashed potatoes.

861
01:09:44.046 --> 01:09:48.358
But this is very nice.

862
01:09:50.085 --> 01:09:52.565
How did you get so talented?

863
01:09:54.390 --> 01:09:56.996
- Are you hungry?
- Yes.

864
01:10:09.505 --> 01:10:11.712
- Are you sick?
- Huh?

865
01:10:13.642 --> 01:10:14.642
Oh...

866
01:10:15.578 --> 01:10:19.287
At this age, you're always sick.

867
01:10:20.449 --> 01:10:21.553
Eat up.

868
01:10:33.062 --> 01:10:38.569
The thought of leaving this
house makes me sentimental.

869
01:11:58.814 --> 01:12:02.193
- Seok-ho!
- Oh, you're back.

870
01:12:02.418 --> 01:12:06.491
Why aren't you opening the sea urchins?

871
01:12:06.555 --> 01:12:10.560
This is important, too.

872
01:12:10.626 --> 01:12:12.936
Look at this.

873
01:12:13.062 --> 01:12:14.063
What is it?

874
01:12:15.531 --> 01:12:18.137
Eat this if you get hungry.

875
01:12:18.467 --> 01:12:19.467
Okay.

876
01:12:19.501 --> 01:12:23.204
Be careful of cars and people in Seoul.

877
01:12:23.205 --> 01:12:24.343
Okay?

878
01:12:25.574 --> 01:12:31.115
I can't bear to be apart for even one day.

879
01:12:32.448 --> 01:12:33.514
Do well.

880
01:12:33.515 --> 01:12:36.052
We'll be off, ma'am.

881
01:12:36.318 --> 01:12:39.128
Please look after my Hye-ji.

882
01:12:39.221 --> 01:12:41.292
- Don't worry.
- Thank you.

883
01:12:42.658 --> 01:12:43.658
Let's go.

884
01:12:44.093 --> 01:12:45.163
Good luck!

885
01:12:50.265 --> 01:12:51.265
What is it?

886
01:12:52.201 --> 01:12:53.646
Take this sunblock.

887
01:12:53.769 --> 01:12:55.112
You use it.

888
01:12:55.738 --> 01:12:59.584
Make sure you apply a lot of it.

889
01:13:00.175 --> 01:13:01.279
Okay.

890
01:13:04.079 --> 01:13:05.149
I'll get going.

891
01:13:05.681 --> 01:13:07.160
I see, hurry to go.

892
01:13:10.719 --> 01:13:12.027
Good luck!

893
01:13:14.189 --> 01:13:16.669
I'll check your ticket. Here.

894
01:13:27.136 --> 01:13:28.479
Hello, Ma'am.

895
01:13:28.570 --> 01:13:30.015
Hye-ji's gone.

896
01:13:30.072 --> 01:13:31.107
Hye-ji.

897
01:13:32.107 --> 01:13:34.087
Go on ahead.

898
01:13:34.176 --> 01:13:36.156
- See you.
- Good bye.

899
01:13:51.193 --> 01:13:52.263
Thanks, Hye-ji.

900
01:13:53.695 --> 01:13:54.469
Daddy will...

901
01:13:54.596 --> 01:13:56.200
For the last time...

902
01:13:57.599 --> 01:13:59.203
Get out of my life.

903
01:14:04.973 --> 01:14:07.010
Thank you. Thank you.

904
01:14:14.583 --> 01:14:15.583
Hey!

905
01:14:16.151 --> 01:14:17.152
Hye-ji!

906
01:14:18.220 --> 01:14:19.699
What took you so long?

907
01:14:19.822 --> 01:14:21.165
Hurry up.

908
01:14:31.266 --> 01:14:33.576
Are you nervous?

909
01:14:35.070 --> 01:14:39.075
Well, so are the others.

910
01:14:39.174 --> 01:14:40.619
They're all nervous.

911
01:14:41.143 --> 01:14:42.144
Start drawing.

912
01:14:44.279 --> 01:14:46.350
I'll go take a nap.

913
01:14:48.116 --> 01:14:51.222
Make sure you check how much time is left.

914
01:14:51.753 --> 01:14:52.753
All right?

915
01:14:57.693 --> 01:14:58.693
Hey!

916
01:14:59.061 --> 01:15:00.199
Long time no see!

917
01:15:02.130 --> 01:15:04.167
- It's been so long!
- How have you been?

918
01:15:04.266 --> 01:15:06.303
Good, do you want
to go get coffee?

919
01:15:06.368 --> 01:15:08.245
I'd love that!

920
01:15:08.303 --> 01:15:09.907
What a nice surprise.

921
01:15:20.082 --> 01:15:21.082
<i>Hello?</i>

922
01:15:24.653 --> 01:15:26.724
<i>Participants, you have
ten minutes left.</i>

923
01:15:27.089 --> 01:15:32.061
<i>Please make sure you
hand in your drawings.</i>

924
01:15:32.227 --> 01:15:38.269
<i>Please make sure you
hand in your drawings.</i>

925
01:16:00.389 --> 01:16:01.663
<i>Mr. Lee...</i>

926
01:16:02.391 --> 01:16:06.965
<i>The title of this work
is 'Confession'.</i>

927
01:16:08.697 --> 01:16:11.371
<i>Please look after
my grandmother.</i>

928
01:16:12.568 --> 01:16:13.979
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

929
01:16:14.603 --> 01:16:17.049
<i>Also, thank you.</i>

930
01:16:19.608 --> 01:16:20.609
<i>Mr. Lee...</i>

931
01:16:23.145 --> 01:16:30.427
<i>The light still feels
strange to me.</i>

932
01:16:32.754 --> 01:16:35.030
- Mrs. Hong...
- Yeah?

933
01:16:45.467 --> 01:16:47.174
Where's Hye-ji?

934
01:16:47.502 --> 01:16:51.382
She went to an art contest.

935
01:16:51.440 --> 01:16:54.011
Oh, she's in Seoul.

936
01:17:01.383 --> 01:17:03.056
Ma'am...

937
01:17:07.356 --> 01:17:08.664
Mrs. Hong...

938
01:17:08.757 --> 01:17:10.361
What the hell is it?

939
01:17:17.566 --> 01:17:19.603
- Well...
- What is this?

940
01:17:21.003 --> 01:17:25.110
It's a DNA test
of you and Hye-ji.

941
01:17:25.173 --> 01:17:27.175
<i>Not related</i>

942
01:17:28.543 --> 01:17:30.181
You're wasting my time.

943
01:17:34.750 --> 01:17:36.252
Ma'am...

944
01:17:43.225 --> 01:17:49.267
It's time for you to
face the facts.

945
01:17:49.331 --> 01:17:55.009
It says that you and
Hye-ji aren't related.

946
01:17:56.171 --> 01:17:58.344
Then, who could she be?

947
01:17:58.407 --> 01:18:04.653
Why would she
pretend to be Hye-ji?

948
01:18:05.547 --> 01:18:06.685
Exactly.

949
01:18:09.484 --> 01:18:12.021
But...

950
01:18:12.688 --> 01:18:13.462
Awhile ago...

951
01:18:13.522 --> 01:18:15.423
I caught her going
through your closet.

952
01:18:15.424 --> 01:18:19.998
- You should check...
- Get lost!

953
01:18:21.963 --> 01:18:23.442
You were going
through my closet!

954
01:18:23.498 --> 01:18:26.274
Do you want my money so much?

955
01:18:29.337 --> 01:18:31.078
Yes, I went through it.

956
01:18:33.208 --> 01:18:36.018
You're being so frustrating!

957
01:18:38.246 --> 01:18:39.623
Do what you want!

958
01:18:55.764 --> 01:18:59.234
Mrs. Hong, I think this is fake.

959
01:19:00.068 --> 01:19:03.379
I'll make them do another test.

960
01:19:17.085 --> 01:19:19.326
- Hello, sir!
- Good evening!

961
01:19:19.387 --> 01:19:22.459
Are you getting drunk
out on the streets?

962
01:19:23.125 --> 01:19:24.125
Hey!

963
01:19:25.527 --> 01:19:26.733
You talking to me?

964
01:19:31.366 --> 01:19:33.312
- It's Hye-ji!
- Hye-ji!

965
01:19:34.236 --> 01:19:35.112
Wow...

966
01:19:35.203 --> 01:19:37.547
You look so good that
I didn't recognize you.

967
01:19:39.207 --> 01:19:42.518
- What are you glaring at?
- Where is Min-hee?

968
01:19:42.644 --> 01:19:44.512
- Goddamn it!
- Give me the bag.

969
01:19:44.513 --> 01:19:46.618
- Hye-ji!
- Min-hee!

970
01:19:47.048 --> 01:19:48.322
- Get off of me!
- Hye-ji!

971
01:19:48.383 --> 01:19:49.088
Min-hee!

972
01:19:49.151 --> 01:19:50.391
Damn it.

973
01:19:50.652 --> 01:19:51.687
Give it!

974
01:19:53.255 --> 01:19:53.888
Bitch!

975
01:19:53.889 --> 01:19:55.232
I knew you would hit me.

976
01:19:58.693 --> 01:20:00.502
Why are you guys doing this?

977
01:20:07.569 --> 01:20:10.106
- I knew it!
- Get off of me!

978
01:20:13.708 --> 01:20:15.085
Nam Hye-ji.

979
01:20:15.310 --> 01:20:17.551
Do you know how many
crimes you were charged with?

980
01:20:17.646 --> 01:20:22.459
If it weren't for your friend,
you'd be framed for all of them.

981
01:20:24.186 --> 01:20:26.496
Who should I put down
as your guardian?

982
01:20:27.322 --> 01:20:29.598
- Let go of me!
- Calm down, ma'am!

983
01:20:30.158 --> 01:20:31.692
- Hye-ji!
- Ma'am...

984
01:20:31.693 --> 01:20:33.229
- Hye-ji...
- You can't come in here.

985
01:20:33.295 --> 01:20:34.603
Let me go.

986
01:20:35.330 --> 01:20:38.641
You look so unwell.

987
01:20:39.034 --> 01:20:41.241
Come on, let's go home.

988
01:20:41.303 --> 01:20:43.305
Ma'am, please calm down.

989
01:20:43.405 --> 01:20:44.281
Let's go.

990
01:20:44.372 --> 01:20:46.181
Let go of me!

991
01:20:52.414 --> 01:20:53.415
Hye-ji...

992
01:20:54.282 --> 01:20:56.319
You're Hye-ji, right?

993
01:20:59.688 --> 01:21:04.637
People keep telling
me that you're not.

994
01:21:04.693 --> 01:21:08.607
But I won't believe it.

995
01:21:08.663 --> 01:21:11.303
You said that you're Hye-ji.

996
01:21:12.000 --> 01:21:14.139
Look at me.

997
01:21:14.603 --> 01:21:16.207
Look at your grandma.

998
01:21:18.640 --> 01:21:20.142
I'm sorry.

999
01:21:34.422 --> 01:21:35.492
Then...

1000
01:21:37.259 --> 01:21:39.398
Where's Hye-ji?

1001
01:21:39.594 --> 01:21:42.131
My Hye-ji...

1002
01:21:43.298 --> 01:21:44.365
Where is she?

1003
01:21:44.366 --> 01:21:46.277
You need to calm down.

1004
01:21:46.368 --> 01:21:48.211
Let's go sit down.

1005
01:21:52.807 --> 01:21:57.256
The security camera caught you
and your daughter confessed.

1006
01:21:57.345 --> 01:21:58.847
You can't deny it.

1007
01:22:00.382 --> 01:22:02.384
So, just give up.

1008
01:22:03.218 --> 01:22:05.494
Hye-ji is dead.

1009
01:22:06.721 --> 01:22:08.166
<i>Hye-ji...</i>

1010
01:22:09.724 --> 01:22:12.637
I miss grandma.

1011
01:22:12.694 --> 01:22:15.607
Take me back to her.

1012
01:22:16.197 --> 01:22:18.575
I told you to stop mentioning her!

1013
01:22:18.633 --> 01:22:19.941
Why do you keep doing it?

1014
01:22:23.438 --> 01:22:25.440
We can't afford to raise two kids.

1015
01:22:25.507 --> 01:22:28.215
If you're worried about money...

1016
01:22:28.276 --> 01:22:30.051
Stop gambling.

1017
01:22:30.145 --> 01:22:32.780
- Why do you bring that up?
- Why wouldn't I?

1018
01:22:32.781 --> 01:22:35.516
- You kidnapped her!
- No, I didn't!

1019
01:22:35.517 --> 01:22:38.259
- You brought her whatever you feel!
- I will raise up her.

1020
01:22:38.320 --> 01:22:39.320
Am I wrong?

1021
01:22:45.160 --> 01:22:47.731
I'm from KIG Insurance.

1022
01:22:47.796 --> 01:22:51.471
I'm looking for Nam Hyun-cheol.

1023
01:22:51.766 --> 01:22:55.145
You'll have to look for him yourself.

1024
01:23:01.409 --> 01:23:04.219
Is there a Nam Hyun-cheol here?

1025
01:23:07.115 --> 01:23:10.187
That would be me.

1026
01:23:10.552 --> 01:23:13.158
We saw the pictures from today's accident.

1027
01:23:13.221 --> 01:23:17.192
It says here that you have two daughters.

1028
01:23:17.258 --> 01:23:21.035
Nam Eun-joo is my biological daughter.

1029
01:23:21.129 --> 01:23:24.338
I'll record the two deaths.

1030
01:23:24.799 --> 01:23:26.073
Hye-ji...

1031
01:23:27.736 --> 01:23:31.081
At least you survived.

1032
01:23:33.575 --> 01:23:37.079
I know you're going through a hard time

1033
01:23:37.278 --> 01:23:42.352
but there's some paperwork
you need to fill out.

1034
01:23:44.185 --> 01:23:45.186
I'm terribly sorry.

1035
01:23:47.722 --> 01:23:49.565
What a horrible father.

1036
01:23:51.459 --> 01:23:54.269
How could he use his children?

1037
01:23:54.796 --> 01:23:58.403
Switching his own child to
commit insurance fraud...

1038
01:23:58.466 --> 01:23:59.570
<i>Nam Eun-joo</i>

1039
01:23:59.634 --> 01:24:01.341
That bastard.

1040
01:24:16.418 --> 01:24:17.988
Ma'am!

1041
01:24:18.086 --> 01:24:19.156
Mrs. Hong!

1042
01:24:20.422 --> 01:24:21.422
Mrs. Hong!

1043
01:24:22.090 --> 01:24:23.660
It wasn't prostitution, right?

1044
01:24:26.394 --> 01:24:30.570
You lured him to the motel
only to steal his money.

1045
01:24:32.233 --> 01:24:34.338
<i>Prosecutor Kim Min-sung</i>

1046
01:24:34.436 --> 01:24:37.178
I'll take your silence to mean 'yes'.

1047
01:24:38.540 --> 01:24:43.649
Do you admit to committing identity theft?

1048
01:24:52.454 --> 01:24:53.626
Thumbprint, please.

1049
01:25:22.450 --> 01:25:24.361
<i>Who is this?</i>

1050
01:25:25.587 --> 01:25:30.058
This is Seok-ho and my grandma.

1051
01:25:30.258 --> 01:25:32.704
This is Toya, the outhouse pig.

1052
01:25:32.760 --> 01:25:37.072
If you poop, he
comes and eats it.

1053
01:25:37.599 --> 01:25:38.475
He eats poop?

1054
01:25:38.533 --> 01:25:42.675
Yes, but if you pee
he gets disappointed.

1055
01:25:45.406 --> 01:25:51.584
Here, you can have
this gold crayon.

1056
01:25:52.213 --> 01:25:55.126
Can I really have it?

1057
01:25:56.317 --> 01:25:57.317
Yes.

1058
01:25:57.552 --> 01:26:01.193
<i>But you have to give it back
when you see grandma.</i>

1059
01:26:01.723 --> 01:26:04.567
<i>I have to color my grandma's hair.</i>

1060
01:27:11.492 --> 01:27:13.438
<i>Grandma!</i>

1061
01:27:20.435 --> 01:27:23.109
Grandma, I'm hungry!

1062
01:27:30.712 --> 01:27:34.091
Oh, sweetie...

1063
01:27:35.617 --> 01:27:37.096
Let's eat.

1064
01:27:52.700 --> 01:27:53.974
Ma'am.

1065
01:27:56.604 --> 01:27:57.639
Ma'am...

1066
01:27:59.774 --> 01:28:03.017
Hello, I'm Hye-ji's an teacher.

1067
01:28:06.114 --> 01:28:11.587
Hye-ji placed high in the art contest.

1068
01:28:13.554 --> 01:28:15.966
Take it away.

1069
01:28:20.561 --> 01:28:22.097
Please take a look.

1070
01:28:23.164 --> 01:28:29.080
Thanks to you, she learned
to focus on the light.

1071
01:28:31.139 --> 01:28:36.020
It's a painting of you,
so please look at it.

1072
01:28:42.817 --> 01:28:43.887
I'm sorry.

1073
01:28:49.624 --> 01:28:50.932
I'll get going.

1074
01:30:12.440 --> 01:30:14.750
<i>'Confession' by Lee Hye-ji</i>

1075
01:30:58.152 --> 01:31:00.632
<i>1 year later</i>

1076
01:31:07.228 --> 01:31:10.107
I can't believe we are in a book store.

1077
01:31:13.167 --> 01:31:17.081
So you've never visited her
since you left?

1078
01:31:19.640 --> 01:31:21.642
Just go and beg over and over.

1079
01:31:25.746 --> 01:31:27.657
- What a dumbass.
- What?

1080
01:31:29.617 --> 01:31:31.187
What? Why do you make it so complicated?

1081
01:31:33.221 --> 01:31:34.359
Thank you.

1082
01:31:35.189 --> 01:31:36.327
Welcome.

1083
01:31:46.200 --> 01:31:48.146
Is it okay to take a break?
Aren't you busy?

1084
01:31:48.202 --> 01:31:49.476
Yes, I'm okay.

1085
01:31:50.638 --> 01:31:52.117
But what brings you...?

1086
01:31:53.774 --> 01:31:56.050
Well I'm just wondering..

1087
01:31:56.711 --> 01:32:01.490
if she comes to see you these days.

1088
01:32:03.784 --> 01:32:04.784
Sorry?

1089
01:32:09.757 --> 01:32:11.293
Last week...

1090
01:32:13.394 --> 01:32:14.771
She disappeared.

1091
01:32:16.597 --> 01:32:18.474
We wanted her to live with us.

1092
01:32:20.601 --> 01:32:22.478
She insisted on staying
at senior care center.

1093
01:32:26.173 --> 01:32:27.173
Why...

1094
01:32:29.210 --> 01:32:31.121
Didn't you tell me?

1095
01:32:31.279 --> 01:32:33.225
She's so stubborn.

1096
01:32:36.417 --> 01:32:39.830
She kept asking me not to tell you.

1097
01:33:00.074 --> 01:33:01.553
<i>Missing child Lee Hye-ji</i>

1098
01:33:01.642 --> 01:33:03.212
Bangshin Marketplace?

1099
01:33:18.492 --> 01:33:21.728
Have you seen this person?

1100
01:33:21.729 --> 01:33:22.434
No.

1101
01:33:22.530 --> 01:33:23.565
How much is this?

1102
01:33:23.731 --> 01:33:26.109
- Please take a closer look.
- I've never seen her.

1103
01:33:28.169 --> 01:33:30.809
Have you seen this person?

1104
01:33:31.205 --> 01:33:32.775
Have you seen this person?

1105
01:33:35.509 --> 01:33:37.489
Mister,
could you see this picture?

1106
01:33:37.545 --> 01:33:38.545
Give me that.

1107
01:33:39.180 --> 01:33:40.318
She looks familiar.

1108
01:33:40.448 --> 01:33:42.359
She was wandering
around a few days ago.

1109
01:33:42.516 --> 01:33:44.723
When was that?

1110
01:33:56.764 --> 01:33:58.141
You mean the dotard?

1111
01:33:58.199 --> 01:34:00.270
Yes, Have you seen her?

1112
01:34:00.668 --> 01:34:02.614
She must be dead already.

1113
01:34:02.737 --> 01:34:04.717
She walked around
for a few days.

1114
01:34:04.772 --> 01:34:08.345
Try the police, maybe
they found her body.

1115
01:34:13.347 --> 01:34:14.883
When did...

1116
01:34:16.717 --> 01:34:18.958
When did you see her?

1117
01:34:19.320 --> 01:34:22.995
It might have been a week ago.

1118
01:34:23.190 --> 01:34:24.726
I'm sure she's dead.

1119
01:34:28.429 --> 01:34:32.377
Why do you keep saying she's dead?

1120
01:34:33.401 --> 01:34:37.110
Have you seen it with your own eyes?

1121
01:34:38.305 --> 01:34:40.182
What a weirdo.

1122
01:34:49.483 --> 01:34:56.264
Let's go diving... Let's go diving...

1123
01:35:05.066 --> 01:35:06.101
Grandma!

1124
01:35:09.170 --> 01:35:10.478
Grandma Gye-chun!

1125
01:35:30.024 --> 01:35:31.094
Grandma...

1126
01:35:38.365 --> 01:35:40.208
It's me.

1127
01:35:40.668 --> 01:35:41.976
Don't you recognize me?

1128
01:35:44.238 --> 01:35:46.582
It's dangerous out here.

1129
01:36:03.991 --> 01:36:05.026
Hye-ji?

1130
01:36:07.161 --> 01:36:08.333
Yes, I'm Hye-ji.

1131
01:36:16.270 --> 01:36:18.011
My baby...

1132
01:36:19.006 --> 01:36:22.351
My grandchild, Hye-ji?

1133
01:36:23.077 --> 01:36:24.077
That's right.

1134
01:36:26.080 --> 01:36:27.525
It's your grandchild, Hye-ji.

1135
01:36:29.617 --> 01:36:33.565
I looked everywhere for you.

1136
01:36:42.096 --> 01:36:44.167
What happened to your shoe?

1137
01:36:46.500 --> 01:36:50.141
From now on, don't go anywhere.

1138
01:36:51.205 --> 01:36:53.446
Stay right by my side.

1139
01:36:53.774 --> 01:36:54.774
Huh?

1140
01:37:41.555 --> 01:37:43.501
I said no.

1141
01:37:43.591 --> 01:37:46.094
The house has been empty for one year.

1142
01:37:46.160 --> 01:37:50.506
We'll pay rent, so everyone will be happy.

1143
01:37:50.564 --> 01:37:52.407
It's not my house.

1144
01:37:52.466 --> 01:37:56.243
- It has an owner.
- I know, but...

1145
01:38:05.646 --> 01:38:07.455
Please...

1146
01:38:08.482 --> 01:38:11.656
I'm begging you.

1147
01:38:13.087 --> 01:38:19.163
I know that you can allow it.

1148
01:38:20.227 --> 01:38:21.570
I'll take care of it.

1149
01:38:28.469 --> 01:38:30.244
Han, be careful!

1150
01:38:30.304 --> 01:38:32.079
Don't worry, Mom.

1151
01:38:38.078 --> 01:38:39.989
This is upside-down!

1152
01:38:40.080 --> 01:38:41.320
I need a rag.

1153
01:38:41.382 --> 01:38:42.382
Here you go.

1154
01:38:45.119 --> 01:38:46.223
Hye-ji. It's Toya!

1155
01:38:46.320 --> 01:38:49.631
He's so old now.

1156
01:38:49.690 --> 01:38:53.160
Everyone, make way for the outhouse pig!

1157
01:38:58.499 --> 01:38:59.637
Oops!

1158
01:39:01.969 --> 01:39:04.381
You should be more careful!

1159
01:39:07.675 --> 01:39:09.916
You planned that, didn't you?

1160
01:39:10.277 --> 01:39:12.086
Apologize to him.

1161
01:39:13.147 --> 01:39:15.957
How could you leave me out?

1162
01:39:16.050 --> 01:39:18.223
I want to be a part, too.

1163
01:39:18.285 --> 01:39:20.128
- What can I do?
- Hurry up!

1164
01:39:20.187 --> 01:39:21.325
Sweep the floor.

1165
01:39:21.388 --> 01:39:22.890
Here you go.

1166
01:39:23.023 --> 01:39:23.592
Sweep the floor?

1167
01:39:23.691 --> 01:39:25.637
All right.

1168
01:39:35.502 --> 01:39:36.572
She's here.

1169
01:39:40.307 --> 01:39:41.308
Mrs. Hong!

1170
01:39:44.345 --> 01:39:45.619
Sit over here.

1171
01:40:02.162 --> 01:40:03.937
Why are you all standing?

1172
01:40:04.498 --> 01:40:06.341
Do you recognize me?

1173
01:40:07.434 --> 01:40:08.674
Of course.

1174
01:40:09.370 --> 01:40:12.180
I'm not blind, you know.

1175
01:40:12.740 --> 01:40:15.482
I'll make you dinner.

1176
01:40:15.542 --> 01:40:16.987
Do your homework.

1177
01:40:26.387 --> 01:40:29.197
What are you staring at?

1178
01:40:32.393 --> 01:40:36.170
What are you doing in front of my house?

1179
01:40:38.565 --> 01:40:39.635
Grandma...

1180
01:40:40.467 --> 01:40:42.504
Let's get out of the cold.

1181
01:40:50.144 --> 01:40:51.282
Hye-ji...

1182
01:40:53.414 --> 01:40:55.257
Will you be okay on your own?

1183
01:40:56.250 --> 01:40:57.729
Let's get inside.

1184
01:41:28.615 --> 01:41:32.495
Grandma, tell me if you get cold.

1185
01:41:34.088 --> 01:41:35.294
Pretty.

1186
01:41:44.231 --> 01:41:45.403
Grandma?

1187
01:41:47.234 --> 01:41:48.234
Grandma?

1188
01:41:50.637 --> 01:41:51.911
Grandma Gye-chun!

1189
01:41:54.108 --> 01:41:56.782
Grandma!

1190
01:42:12.392 --> 01:42:13.735
Grandma Gye-chun...

1191
01:42:15.362 --> 01:42:18.206
Grandma, don't do that!

1192
01:42:20.200 --> 01:42:22.510
I guess it's too late.

1193
01:42:26.073 --> 01:42:27.211
Aren't you cold?

1194
01:42:37.384 --> 01:42:38.522
Grandma...

1195
01:42:41.388 --> 01:42:43.163
Let me paint on you, too.

1196
01:42:59.606 --> 01:43:01.381
That stings.

1197
01:43:01.441 --> 01:43:03.011
Lift your head.

1198
01:43:04.011 --> 01:43:05.991
Then, it will end faster.

1199
01:43:15.989 --> 01:43:19.129
The sky is in the sea.

1200
01:43:22.196 --> 01:43:24.437
In the sea...

1201
01:43:28.068 --> 01:43:29.638
In the sea...

1202
01:43:35.342 --> 01:43:37.344
You are my sea.

1203
01:43:37.744 --> 01:43:39.621
The sky is in the sea.

1204
01:43:40.547 --> 01:43:41.821
Warm yourself at a stove.

1205
01:43:42.549 --> 01:43:44.153
- Is she asleep?
- Yes, she is.

1206
01:43:44.551 --> 01:43:47.430
Here. It's from my wife.

1207
01:43:55.195 --> 01:43:57.038
Now I'm relieved.

1208
01:43:59.132 --> 01:44:03.547
I would've been hurt if
she didn't recognize us.

1209
01:44:07.407 --> 01:44:10.217
By the way, what's that painting about?

1210
01:44:11.011 --> 01:44:12.046
That's really nice.

1211
01:44:14.248 --> 01:44:15.591
- Seok-ho.
- Yes.

1212
01:44:16.550 --> 01:44:18.552
Which is bigger, the sea or the sky?

1213
01:44:18.619 --> 01:44:20.963
The sky is bigger obviously, isn't it?

1214
01:44:21.688 --> 01:44:23.998
No. The sea is bigger.

1215
01:44:28.228 --> 01:44:32.699
The sea embraces the sky.

1216
01:45:09.169 --> 01:45:10.477
<i>Let's see...</i>

1217
01:45:12.005 --> 01:45:16.647
<i>The password of the account is
0512, 0512.</i>

1218
01:45:18.078 --> 01:45:20.319
<i>Hye-ji can you hear this?</i>

1219
01:45:22.549 --> 01:45:23.584
<i>I'll just</i>

1220
01:45:24.518 --> 01:45:27.055
call you Hye-ji.

1221
01:45:28.789 --> 01:45:36.003
<i>To be honest, I might
have already known...</i>

1222
01:45:39.299 --> 01:45:41.301
that you're not Hye-ji.

1223
01:45:42.502 --> 01:45:45.449
<i>I just didn't want</i>

1224
01:45:45.505 --> 01:45:47.246
to admit it.

1225
01:45:48.742 --> 01:45:51.586
Which is bigger, the sea or the sky?

1226
01:45:51.645 --> 01:46:00.429
<i>I used to think that it
would have been better</i>

1227
01:46:00.520 --> 01:46:08.132
<i>if I'd died without realizing
that you're not Hye-ji.</i>

1228
01:46:12.199 --> 01:46:13.701
But not anymore.

1229
01:46:17.104 --> 01:46:21.553
You're my grandchild, too.

1230
01:46:24.378 --> 01:46:29.987
There's no doubt that
you're my grandchild.

1231
01:46:31.118 --> 01:46:33.098
<i>Being related by blood...</i>

1232
01:46:37.190 --> 01:46:41.605
<i>That doesn't matter at all.</i>

1233
01:46:44.598 --> 01:46:46.202
You were always

1234
01:46:46.566 --> 01:46:50.343
my grandchild.

1235
01:46:56.710 --> 01:46:58.451
My granddaughter...

1236
01:46:59.146 --> 01:47:02.184
I made a living as a diver.

1237
01:47:02.382 --> 01:47:07.127
You should make a living as an artist.

1238
01:47:09.256 --> 01:47:11.258
My life was hard.

1239
01:47:13.193 --> 01:47:16.140
But near the end, I met you.

1240
01:47:17.164 --> 01:47:18.234
Soon,

1241
01:47:20.100 --> 01:47:22.080
I'll die.

1242
01:47:24.104 --> 01:47:26.675
But I don't want to leave you...

1243
01:47:33.613 --> 01:47:36.492
<i>I don't want to leave you...</i>

1244
01:47:39.553 --> 01:47:42.966
<i>I don't want to leave you...</i>

1245
01:47:49.062 --> 01:47:52.703
<i>I don't want to leave you...</i>

1246
01:48:04.077 --> 01:48:05.215
I'm sorry.

1247
01:48:10.417 --> 01:48:12.055
I'm sorry.

1248
01:48:20.560 --> 01:48:23.063
Grandma, I'm sorry.

1249
01:48:28.635 --> 01:48:31.013
Grandma...

1250
01:48:49.155 --> 01:48:50.293
Sweetie...

1251
01:49:00.734 --> 01:49:02.839
Grandma, are you okay?

1252
01:49:05.539 --> 01:49:07.541
I was so worried.

1253
01:49:08.975 --> 01:49:15.620
Why did you waste paint like that?

1254
01:49:15.682 --> 01:49:17.559
You wanted to see flowers.

1255
01:49:18.118 --> 01:49:19.859
They're...

1256
01:49:21.655 --> 01:49:25.933
The prettiest flowers I've ever seen.

1257
01:49:33.733 --> 01:49:35.076
Eun-joo...

1258
01:49:41.141 --> 01:49:42.745
Eun-joo...

1259
01:49:44.511 --> 01:49:46.184
Eun-joo...

1260
01:49:51.184 --> 01:49:54.165
It's time for me...

1261
01:49:56.122 --> 01:49:59.103
To join Hye-ji.

1262
01:50:01.261 --> 01:50:03.104
She's so young.

1263
01:50:04.230 --> 01:50:09.111
I kept her waiting for far too long.

1264
01:50:16.509 --> 01:50:18.147
What about me?

1265
01:50:19.179 --> 01:50:21.625
Keep on living.

1266
01:50:24.985 --> 01:50:29.058
Lead a good life.

1267
01:50:30.390 --> 01:50:37.706
I'll never forget you, even in heaven.

1268
01:50:40.300 --> 01:50:48.651
Thank you so much for
becoming my grandchild.

1269
01:51:11.097 --> 01:51:12.098
Grandma.

1270
01:51:16.336 --> 01:51:17.440
Good-bye.

1271
01:51:21.408 --> 01:51:24.048
But don't go too fast.

1272
01:51:29.382 --> 01:51:31.089
Grandma...

1273
01:51:35.221 --> 01:51:36.461
I will.

1274
01:51:40.593 --> 01:51:42.470
I'll lead a good life.

1275
01:51:45.065 --> 01:51:46.442
I promise.

1276
01:51:51.171 --> 01:51:52.309
Grandma...

1277
01:51:54.007 --> 01:51:55.077
I love you.

1278
01:52:16.696 --> 01:52:18.300
Hye-jii.

1279
01:52:19.232 --> 01:52:21.041
Where are you?

1280
01:52:23.470 --> 01:52:25.313
I can't find you!

1281
01:52:28.141 --> 01:52:30.087
Hye-ji!

1282
01:52:32.479 --> 01:52:33.719
Grandma!

1283
01:52:36.249 --> 01:52:38.024
Where are you?

1284
01:52:39.753 --> 01:52:41.528
I can't find you!

1285
01:52:42.288 --> 01:52:44.131
Grandma!

1286
01:52:44.624 --> 01:52:46.501
Come find me!

1287
01:52:47.160 --> 01:52:48.662
Hye-ji!

1288
01:52:49.229 --> 01:52:51.140
Grandma!

1289
01:52:52.298 --> 01:52:54.244
I'm right here!

1290
01:52:55.502 --> 01:52:58.449
Grandma Gye-chun!

1291
01:52:58.505 --> 01:53:00.041
Oh...

1292
01:53:00.106 --> 01:53:01.983
- My baby.
- Grandma!

1293
01:53:03.076 --> 01:53:05.181
What took you so long?

1294
01:53:12.552 --> 01:53:14.691
Did you miss me?

1295
01:53:15.021 --> 01:53:18.025
I missed you so much.

1296
01:53:22.162 --> 01:53:23.106
Grandma.

1297
01:53:23.163 --> 01:53:24.574
Don't go anywhere.

1298
01:53:25.064 --> 01:53:28.238
Yeah, I won't go anywhere.

1299
01:53:57.263 --> 01:53:58.742
Artist Lee.

1300
01:53:59.265 --> 01:54:01.040
- Over here.
- Look at this.

1301
01:54:02.368 --> 01:54:07.010
- It's me and Mrs. Hong!
- You're right.

1302
01:54:07.140 --> 01:54:08.483
You're in it, too.

1303
01:54:10.076 --> 01:54:13.387
This was Hye-ji's welcome home party!

1304
01:54:13.446 --> 01:54:14.550
Look at that!

1305
01:54:17.217 --> 01:54:18.389
Wow...

1306
01:54:19.219 --> 01:54:21.495
She's so talented.

1307
01:54:22.255 --> 01:54:24.667
This looks just like Mrs. Hong.

1308
01:54:25.592 --> 01:54:27.162
Is that your grandma?

1309
01:54:27.260 --> 01:54:31.106
I wish she could have seen this.

1310
01:54:31.464 --> 01:54:32.499
Me, too.

1311
01:54:34.234 --> 01:54:35.440
It's great.

1312
01:54:38.605 --> 01:54:40.676
It's all thanks to you.

1313
01:54:44.177 --> 01:54:49.183
But there is something you learn
naturally as you get growing.
